Output demo.gif
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 920
Set Height 560
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 35ms
Set Framerate 24
Set Shell bash

Hide
Type "python3 -m venv gifenv && source gifenv/bin/activate && export PIP_DISABLE_PIP_VERSION_CHECK=1 PIP_NO_PYTHON_VERSION_WARNING=1"
Enter
Sleep 8s
Type "clear"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Show

Type "pip install turboloader"
Enter
Sleep 8s
Type "python demo.py"
Enter
Sleep 7s
Sleep 3s
